OL,4,CLong delays on M25 due to tunnel defect
OL,5,GThere are delays of about 90 minutes   
OL,6,Gon the M25, due to one of the tunnels  
OL,7,Gat the Dartford Crossing being closed  
OL,8,Gafter a defect was found during        
OL,9,Governight works.                       
OL,11,FNational Highways said it was found    
OL,12,Fduring overnight works, meaning it     
OL,13,Fcould not reopen at 05:00 GMT as was   
OL,14,Fscheduled.                             
OL,16,FIt said that the east bore of the      
OL,17,Ftunnel will remain closed "until       
OL,18,Frepairs have been carried out", with   
OL,19,Fspecialist repair crews attending on   
OL,20,FMonday morning.                        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
