OL,4,C'A rogue roofer swindled us out of     
OL,5,C#8,500'                                
OL,6,GA Kent pensioner has welcomed the 28-  
OL,7,Gmonth prison sentence of a rogue       
OL,8,Gtrader who swindled her out of #8,500  
OL,9,Gand damaged her roof.                  
OL,11,FJennifer and Bernard Gilbert, from     
OL,12,FGillingham, said Billy Beaney cold-    
OL,13,Fcalled at their home of 56 years in    
OL,14,FNovember 2025, telling them a roof     
OL,15,Ftile was damaged.                      
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old then offered to carry  
OL,18,Fout the work for free in return for a  
OL,19,Frecommendation on his website. But     
OL,20,Fafter he started, he claimed there     
OL,21,Fwere problems which would cost #26,000 
OL,22,Fto fix.                           G4/4 
